 "name_en": "Formulation – Recipe Development (1QC)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Formulation – Recipe Development (1QC)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loiof016f9243c3e426eb7a4839c3e89c049\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiof016f9243c3e426eb7a4839c3e89c049__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">This scope item provides Web applications to handle formulas. Formula calculation allows calculation of recipe composition and aggregation of components (such as allergens) for the formula based on the proportions of the ingredients. To facilitate comparisons between recipes derived from each other, you can display several formulas side by side. You can manage ingredients and output substances, subcomponents (for example, pure substances, nutrients, or allergens) with role-based Web applications.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiof016f9243c3e426eb7a4839c3e89c049__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Review recipe and decide to use a new ingredient</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create a development recipe by copying an existing recipe</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Modify recipe ingredients</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Release recipe</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiof016f9243c3e426eb7a4839c3e89c049__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Store all product development (product and process) information centrally (single source of truth)</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Reduce redundant or inconsistent data</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Integrate with downstream use of formula development information in logistics processes directly</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>配制 - 配方开发 (1QC)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loiof016f9243c3e426eb7a4839c3e89c049\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiof016f9243c3e426eb7a4839c3e89c049__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">此范围项目提供用于处理公式的 Web 应用程序。通过公式计算，可以根据成分比例计算配方的配方成分和公式组件（例如过敏原）汇总。为便于比较相互派生的配方，您可以并排显示多个公式。您可以使用基于角色的 Web 应用程序管理成分和输出物质、子组件（例如，纯物质、营养成分或过敏原）。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiof016f9243c3e426eb7a4839c3e89c049__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">检查配方并决定使用新成分</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">通过复制现有配方创建开发配方</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">修改配方成分</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">发布配方</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiof016f9243c3e426eb7a4839c3e89c049__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">集中存储所有产品开发（产品和流程）信息（单一事实来源）</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">减少冗余或不一致的数据</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">直接集成物流流程中公式开发信息的下游使用。</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
